{"id":"torrey:cities","source":"torrey","name":"Cities","slug":"cities","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"First mention of — Ge 4:17.","refs":[["Gen",4,17,4,17]]},{"text":"Designed for habitations — Ps 107:7,36.","refs":[["Ps",107,7,107,7],["Ps",107,36,107,36]]},{"text":"Often built to perpetuate a name — Ge 11:4.","refs":[["Gen",11,4,11,4]]},{"text":"Often founded and enlarged by blood and rapine — Mic 3:10; Hab 2:12.","refs":[["Mic",3,10,3,10],["Hab",2,12,2,12]]},{"text":"Of brick and slime. — Ge 11:3.","refs":[["Gen",11,3,11,3]]},{"text":"Of stone and wood. — Ps 102:14; Eze 26:12.","refs":[["Ps",102,14,102,14],["Ezek",26,12,26,12]]},{"text":"Of brick and mortar. — Ex 1:11,14.","refs":[["Exod",1,11,1,11],["Exod",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"On solid foundations. — Ezr 6:3; Re 21:14.","refs":[["Ezra",6,3,6,3],["Rev",21,14,21,14]]},{"text":"With compactness. — Ps 122:3.","refs":[["Ps",122,3,122,3]]},{"text":"Often of a square form. — Re 21:16.","refs":[["Rev",21,16,21,16]]},{"text":"Beside rivers. — Ps 46:4; 137:1.","refs":[["Ps",46,4,46,4],["Ps",137,1,137,1]]},{"text":"On hills. — Mt 5:14; Lu 4:29; Re 17:9.","refs":[["Matt",5,14,5,14],["Luke",4,29,4,29],["Rev",17,9,17,9]]},{"text":"In plains. — Ge 11:2,4; 13:12.","refs":[["Gen",11,2,11,2],["Gen",11,4,11,4],["Gen",13,12,13,12]]},{"text":"In desert places. — 2Ch 8:4; Ps 107:35,36.","refs":[["2Chr",8,4,8,4],["Ps",107,35,107,35],["Ps",107,36,107,36]]},{"text":"In pleasant situations. — 2Ki 2:19; Ps 48:2.","refs":[["2Kgs",2,19,2,19],["Ps",48,2,48,2]]},{"text":"Arranged in streets and lanes — Nu 22:39; Zec 8:5; Lu 14:21.","refs":[["Num",22,39,22,39],["Zech",8,5,8,5],["Luke",14,21,14,21]]},{"text":"Entered through gates — Ge 34:24; Ne 13:19,22.","refs":[["Gen",34,24,34,24],["Neh",13,19,13,19],["Neh",13,22,13,22]]},{"text":"Surrounded with walls — De 1:28; 3:5.","refs":[["Deut",1,28,1,28],["Deut",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Often fortified by nature — Ps 125:2; Isa 33:16.","refs":[["Ps",125,2,125,2],["Isa",33,16,33,16]]},{"text":"Often fortified by art — 2Ch 11:5-10,23; Ps 48:12,13; Jer 4:5; Da 11:15.","refs":[["2Chr",11,5,11,10],["2Chr",11,23,11,23],["Ps",48,12,48,12],["Ps",48,13,48,13],["Jer",4,5,4,5],["Dan",11,15,11,15]]},{"text":"Sometimes had suburbs — Nu 35:2; Jos 21:3.","refs":[["Num",35,2,35,2],["Josh",21,3,21,3]]},{"text":"The family of the founder. — Ge 4:17; Jdj 18:29.","refs":[["Gen",4,17,4,17],["Judg",18,29,18,29]]},{"text":"The proprietor of the land. — 1Ki 16:24.","refs":[["1Kgs",16,24,16,24]]},{"text":"The country in which built. — Da 4:29,30.","refs":[["Dan",4,29,4,29],["Dan",4,30,4,30]]},{"text":"Numerous — Jos 15:21; 1Ch 2:22; Jer 2:28.","refs":[["Josh",15,21,15,21],["1Chr",2,22,2,22],["Jer",2,28,2,28]]},{"text":"Densely inhabited — Jon 4:11; Na 3:8.","refs":[["Jonah",4,11,4,11],["Nah",3,8,3,8]]},{"text":"Often great and goodly — Ge 10:12; De 6:10; Da 4:30; Jon 3:3.","refs":[["Gen",10,12,10,12],["Deut",6,10,6,10],["Dan",4,30,4,30],["Jonah",3,3,3,3]]},{"text":"Often of great antiquity — Ge 10:11,12.","refs":[["Gen",10,11,10,11],["Gen",10,12,10,12]]},{"text":"Often insignificant — Ge 19:20; Ec 9:14.","refs":[["Gen",19,20,19,20],["Eccl",9,14,9,14]]},{"text":"Royal. — Nu 21:26; Jos 10:2; 2Sa 12:26.","refs":[["Num",21,26,21,26],["Josh",10,2,10,2],["2Sam",12,26,12,26]]},{"text":"Fenced. — Jos 10:20; Isa 36:1.","refs":[["Josh",10,20,10,20],["Isa",36,1,36,1]]},{"text":"Treasure. — Ex 1:11.","refs":[["Exod",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Commercial. — Isa 23:11; Eze 27:3.","refs":[["Isa",23,11,23,11],["Ezek",27,3,27,3]]},{"text":"Chariot. — 2Ch 1:14; 9:25.","refs":[["2Chr",1,14,1,14],["2Chr",9,25,9,25]]},{"text":"Store. — 2Ch 8:4,6.","refs":[["2Chr",8,4,8,4],["2Chr",8,6,8,6]]},{"text":"Levitical. — Le 25:32,33; Nu 35:7,8.","refs":[["Lev",25,32,25,32],["Lev",25,33,25,33],["Num",35,7,35,7],["Num",35,8,35,8]]},{"text":"Refuge. — Nu 35:6.","refs":[["Num",35,6,35,6]]},{"text":"Inhabitants of, called citizens — Ac 21:39.","refs":[["Acts",21,39,21,39]]},{"text":"Prosperity of, increased by commerce — Ge 49:13; De 33:18,19; Eze 28:5.","refs":[["Gen",49,13,49,13],["Deut",33,18,33,18],["Deut",33,19,33,19],["Ezek",28,5,28,5]]},{"text":"Artificial mode of supplying water to — 2Ki 18:17; 20:20.","refs":[["2Kgs",18,17,18,17],["2Kgs",20,20,20,20]]},{"text":"Infested by dogs — 1Ki 14:11; Ps 59:6,14.","refs":[["1Kgs",14,11,14,11],["Ps",59,6,59,6],["Ps",59,14,59,14]]},{"text":"Under governors — 2Ch 33:14; 2Co 11:32.","refs":[["2Chr",33,14,33,14],["2Cor",11,32,11,32]]},{"text":"Provided with judges — De 16:18; 2Ch 19:5.","refs":[["Deut",16,18,16,18],["2Chr",19,5,19,5]]},{"text":"Protected at night by watchmen — Ps 127:1; Song 5:7; Isa 21:11.","refs":[["Ps",127,1,127,1],["Song",5,7,5,7],["Isa",21,11,21,11]]},{"text":"Furnished with stores — 2Ch 11:11,12.","refs":[["2Chr",11,11,11,11],["2Chr",11,12,11,12]]},{"text":"Garrisoned in war — 2Ch 17:2,19.","refs":[["2Chr",17,2,17,2],["2Chr",17,19,17,19]]},{"text":"Often had citadels — Jdj 9:51.","refs":[["Judg",9,51,9,51]]},{"text":"A great defence to a country — 2Ch 11:5.","refs":[["2Chr",11,5,11,5]]},{"text":"Afforded refuge in times of danger — Jer 8:14-16.","refs":[["Jer",8,14,8,16]]},{"text":"Often deserted on the approach of an enemy — 1Sa 31:7; Jer 4:20.","refs":[["1Sam",31,7,31,7],["Jer",4,20,4,20]]},{"text":"Stormed. — Jos 8:3-7; Jdj 9:44.","refs":[["Josh",8,3,8,7],["Judg",9,44,9,44]]},{"text":"Besieged. — De 28:52; 2Ki 19:24,25.","refs":[["Deut",28,52,28,52],["2Kgs",19,24,19,24],["2Kgs",19,25,19,25]]},{"text":"Pillaged. — Isa 13:16; Jer 20:5.","refs":[["Isa",13,16,13,16],["Jer",20,5,20,5]]},{"text":"Wasted by pestilence. — 1Sa 5:11.","refs":[["1Sam",5,11,5,11]]},{"text":"Wasted by famine. — Jer 52:6; Am 4:6.","refs":[["Jer",52,6,52,6],["Amos",4,6,4,6]]},{"text":"Depopulated. — Isa 17:9; Eze 26:19.","refs":[["Isa",17,9,17,9],["Ezek",26,19,26,19]]},{"text":"Burned. — Jdj 20:38,40; Isa 1:7.","refs":[["Judg",20,38,20,38],["Judg",20,40,20,40],["Isa",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"Made heaps of ruins. — Isa 25:2.","refs":[["Isa",25,2,25,2]]},{"text":"Razed and sown with salt. — Jdj 9:45.","refs":[["Judg",9,45,9,45]]},{"text":"Difficulty of taking, alluded to — Pr 18:19; Jer 1:18,19.","refs":[["Prov",18,19,18,19],["Jer",1,18,1,18],["Jer",1,19,1,19]]},{"text":"Perishable nature of — Heb 13:14.","refs":[["Heb",13,14,13,14]]},{"text":"Saints. — Mt 5:14.","refs":[["Matt",5,14,5,14]]},{"text":"Visible church. — Song 3:2,3; Re 11:2.","refs":[["Song",3,2,3,2],["Song",3,3,3,3],["Rev",11,2,11,2]]},{"text":"Church triumphant. — Re 21:2; 22:19.","refs":[["Rev",21,2,21,2],["Rev",22,19,22,19]]},{"text":"Heavenly inheritance. — Heb 11:16.","refs":[["Heb",11,16,11,16]]},{"text":"The apostasy. — Re 16:10; 17:18.","refs":[["Rev",16,10,16,10],["Rev",17,18,17,18]]},{"text":"Riches. — Pr 10:15.","refs":[["Prov",10,15,10,15]]}],"refCount":138}
